"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[41,63,32,14,37,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1004305","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，雍州刺史王经部将。姜维北伐时，花永与王经的其余部将一同迎战姜维，但中了姜维的佯败之计，众魏将乘兵追击，中了魏延的埋伏后全部战死。","tc":"魏國武將，雍州刺史王經部將。姜維北伐時，花永與王經的其余部將一同迎戰姜維，但中了姜維的佯敗之計，眾魏將乘兵追擊，中了魏延的埋伏后全部戰死。","en":"An officer of Wei and a subordinate of Wang Jing, Lt. Governor of Yong Province. During Jiang Wei's Northern Expedition, Hua Yong joined Wang Jing's other officers to engage Jiang Wei. However, they fell for Jiang Wei's feigned retreat. The Wei generals pursued with their troops and rode into an ambush set by Wei Yan, where all of them were killed in battle.","jp":"魏の武将。雍州刺史・王経の部将。姜維の北伐の際、花永は王経の他の部将らと共に姜維を迎え撃ったが、姜維の偽りの敗走の計に嵌り、勢いに乗じて追撃した魏の将たちは魏延の伏兵に遭って全員戦死した。","kr":"위나라의 무장으로, 옹주자사 왕경의 부장입니다. 강유가 북벌을 감행했을 때, 화영은 왕경의 다른 부장들과 함께 강유를 맞아 싸웠으나 거짓 패퇴하는 계책에 빠지고 말았습니다. 위나라 장수들이 군사를 몰아 추격하다가 위연의 매복에 걸려 전원 전사했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10920","remark":"","surname":"花","surnameTc":"花","surnameEn":"Hua","surnameJp":"花","surnameKr":"화","surnameOther":"","name":"永","nameTc":"永","nameEn":"Yong","nameJp":"永","nameKr":"영","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"花永","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"225","city":"CS1016","gender":"0","rule":"41","force":"63","wise":"32","politics":"14","charm":"37","will":"53","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"61/20/20/20/20/8/50/20","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","de